
# ── agent automation (RepoScaffold) ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Shareable LOGIC is tracked under .claude/ (workflow-profile.sh, release/, README.md).
# Per-machine RUNTIME is never committed:
.claude/local/                 # worktrees, live ledger, tracker cache + worklogs
.claude/settings.local.json    # this machine's permission settings
CLAUDE.local.md                # personal instruction overrides
reports/                       # CodeQuality scan + loop outputs
.jira-sync/                    # legacy tracker cache location
# ── end agent automation ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
